<title>SINGAPORE: Hongkong Land soars to new 1996 high.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Land soars to new 1996 high.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in property company Hongkong Land Holdings soared US$0.23 on Thursday to another new 1996 high at US$2.70 on top volume of 8.6 million shares.</p>
<p>Dealers said the stock saw buying orders from London and might be driven higher by bullish sentiment over the all-time high property prices seen in Hong Kong and expectations of good earnings.  </p>
<p>A dealer said the inclusion of Hongkong Land in the recently launched Business Times-Singapore Regional Index was also attracting foreign buying.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
